add('5M2','長方體體積','Volume of a cuboid','volume',lambda d:{'a':I(2,3*d),'b':I(2,2+d),'c':I(1,2+d)},'長方體長 {a} 厘米、闊 {b} 厘米、高 {c} 厘米。體積多少立方厘米？','A cuboid measures {a} cm by {b} cm by {c} cm. Find its volume in cubic cm.','a*b*c','先數一層有多少粒單位立方體，再乘層數。','每層 {a} × {b}，共 {c} 層。',tool='solid',visual='solid')
