add('6M2','立方厘米與毫升','Volume and capacity','cm3Ml',lambda d:{'a':I(2,4*d),'b':I(2,5),'c':I(2,4)},'長方體容器內長 {a} 厘米、內闊 {b} 厘米、內高 {c} 厘米。注滿共多少毫升？','A container has internal dimensions {a} cm by {b} cm by {c} cm. How many millilitres does it hold when full?','a*b*c','1立方厘米等於1毫升。用容器的內部尺寸計容量。','先算內部體積 {a} × {b} × {c}，再換成毫升。',tool='solid',visual='solid')
